    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist wont help. they just want to reintegrate me into a world that i know is just gonna break me again. it's like i've built a fortress to survive, but now i'm just a prisoner inside it. there's this heavy realization that i can't be \"fixed\" or \"grown\" out of this. i just want the silence to actually be peaceful instead of heavy. i feel like i've reached a dead end where the only way to stop the walls from closing in is to just... stop being here. it feels like the only logical conclusion left.",
